{
 "schemaVersion": 1,
 "description": "The sub-panel each candidate on a Seanad vocational panel stood on: the Oireachtas sub-panel (nominated by members of the Oireachtas) or the Nominating Bodies sub-panel (nominated by a registered nominating body). Each panel elects a minimum from each sub-panel (Seanad Electoral (Panel Members) Act 1947, as amended), so a count can exclude a candidate with more votes than one who stays in. From the Seanad Returning Officer's panels of candidates (2016, 2020, 2025: every candidate) and statements of the candidates elected (2002, 2007, 2011: the winners only, marked coverage 'winners'); the numbers elected from each sub-panel agree with the Houses of the Oireachtas table of the distribution of seats between the sub-panels, 1989-2025, except where a contest's note says. Keyed by contest file, then by the candidate's name as the contest file gives it. The manifest build carries it on the candidate (subPanel; scripts/lib/candidate-sub-panels.mjs).",
